 "text": "Hi, how are you holding out? Many lakes and streams you can swim in, or ask landowners for a hike, often with a water source. Probably, it's a small drop of water compared to lake it comes from. Stick filling up bottles at home and carry them. Bury them with a bit of sand on top to stop animals digging them up. A few meters apart so each isn't the neighbor's water source. Sorry, but water borne illnesses like Gi bugs are real. You are. Just respect the little pots and dig deep holes.",
